('The Years I Gave — Part 1 (Ese Talks Studio)', 'the-years-i-gave-part-1', 'Neuf ans d''amour, de sacrifices et de prières. Sandra a soutenu Joseph dans la pauvreté et les déceptions ; quand une chance de changer leur vie arrive enfin, elle prend une décision qui pourrait lui coûter ses propres rêves. Joseph a promis de ne jamais oublier son sacrifice… mais l''amour et les promesses suffiront-ils quand la vie change ? Première partie d''un court métrage, la partie 2 suivra. / Nine years of love, sacrifice and prayers. Sandra stood by Joseph through poverty and disappointments; when a chance to change their lives finally came, she made a decision that could cost her own dreams. Joseph promised never to take her sacrifice for granted… but will love and promises be enough when life changes? Part one of a short film, part two to follow.', 2026, 'Nigeria', 'en', 'HPLJc_FK_1w', 'https://img.youtube.com/vi/HPLJc_FK_1w/hqdefault.jpg', '2026-10-25T08:00:07-07:00', true, false),
('The Price of One Mistake (The Only Laurel / The Winlos)', 'the-price-of-one-mistake', NULL, 2026, 'Nigeria', 'en', 'CRR16zDLSfI', 'https://img.youtube.com/vi/CRR16zDLSfI/hqdefault.jpg', '2026-10-26T00:37:29-07:00', true, false);
